      "description": "Watch Gimnasia LP vs Barracas Central highlights and goals from Argentine Primera División on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 10, 2026. A Hard-Fought Affair in La Plata The Liga Profesional Argentina fixture between Gimnasia de La Plata and Barracas Central , played on August 10, 2026, showcased the typical intensity of domestic competition. Both sides approached the match with clear intent, battling for every possession in a contest that demanded focus until the final whistle. Breaking the Deadlock The match dynamics shifted immediately following the halftime break. Just seconds into the second half, Agustin Colazo capitalized on an assist from Pedro Silva Torrejon to fire home the opening goal. As the half progressed, the physical nature of the game intensified, leading to a flurry of yellow cards issued to Alexis Steimbach , Tomas Porra , Augusto Max , and Gonzalo Maroni as both sides fought for control. Securing the Points With Barracas Central pushing forward late in the game in search of an equalizer, gaps inevitably opened up at the back. In the 90+2 minute, Alexis Steimbach turned provider, setting up Franco Torres for a composed finish that extended the lead to 2-0. The goal effectively extinguished any hope of a comeback, handing Gimnasia a well-deserved victory."
